+        'Increase your taxable income',
+      ],
+      correct: 1,
+      explanation: 'Insurance pools risk: you pay a predictable premium so that a rare but potentially devastating loss is borne by the insurer instead of wiping you out. It is protection against catastrophe, not an investment.',
